{
  "id": "3dprLivePinVid014",
  "name": "14 Live Pinterest Video Pin",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ddbce8d2-7452-5d34-995f-c1eabc5c069b",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LIVE Pinterest Video Pin (manual only)\n\nPosts **Product 17** as a video Pin to `PINTEREST_BOARD_ID`:\n1. `POST /v5/media` (media_type video)\n2. tracking-api uploads the local file to the returned S3 form\n3. Poll `GET /v5/media/{id}` until `succeeded`\n4. `POST /v5/pins` with `media_source.source_type = video_id`\n\nDoes not change global `DRY_RUN`. Refuses if already published on Pinterest.\n",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "76f3f207-319b-55c1-a0b7-3f5d68b5d249",
      "name": "Run Manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "a71268aa-010a-517e-8bac-e13dbb3e737a",
